{"id":"94315fedc28f","html":"<div><div><div><h2>Against the tide</h2><p title=\"Duration\">13 MINUTES</p></div><p><a href=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/745038284\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://player.vimeo.com/video/745038284</a></p><div><p>On the small Scottish island of Erraid, members of an off-the-grid community seek to live as close to nature as possible, pursuing a sustainable alternative to the consumerism of the outside world. This means days spent working the land and relying on one another. <em>Against the Tide</em> follows a woman named Gill who decided to upend her life after a relationship breakup, and ‘risk the unknown’ by moving to the island. Capturing the contemplative pace of life on Erraid, the Scotland-based filmmaker Giulia Candussi follows Gill as her six-month trial stay comes to a close, and she and her fellow community members decide if she’ll become a permanent resident.</p></div><div><p>Explore more</p></div><div><div><p><img alt=\"A naked young woman walking on a rippled sandy beach towards the sea, clear blue water and distant islands in view.\" width=\"2160\" height=\"1440\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 360px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/96aef475-004e-4a33-a053-053c7271660b/reset-lucy-landscape-1.jpg?top=0&amp;left=106&amp;cropWidth=2160&amp;cropHeight=1440&amp;width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p></div><a aria-labelledby=\"_R_35aucnpfiv4tb_-title\" aria-describedby=\"_R_35aucnpfiv4tb_-description\" data-ga-carousel=\"Explore more\" href=\"https://psyche.co/videos/for-lucy-surviving-on-a-remote-island-was-hard-but-returning-was-harder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><div><h4>For Lucy, surviving on a remote island was hard, but returning was harder</h4><p>Directed by Jesper Wachtmeister</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"An old, weathered boat hull is grounded in a field with two bare trees under a cloudy sky.\" width=\"1749\" height=\"1166\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 360px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/a2db3994-edb2-4847-9ab3-6324a154ec84/original.jpg?top=0&amp;left=126&amp;cropWidth=1749&amp;cropHeight=1166&amp;width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p></div><a aria-labelledby=\"_R_55aucnpfiv4tb_-title\" aria-describedby=\"_R_55aucnpfiv4tb_-description\" data-ga-carousel=\"Explore more\" href=\"https://psyche.co/videos/scottish-gaelic-songs-send-a-message-in-a-bottle-across-the-oceans-of-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><div><h4>Scottish Gaelic songs send a message in a bottle across the oceans of time</h4><p>Directed by Jamie Chambers</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"A man and woman sit by a calm lake during dusk, with mountains in the background and a dog resting near the woman.\" width=\"1749\" height=\"1166\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 360px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/33c4b7ac-d8d7-4632-be3f-2d0c3fd3d7f7/original.jpg?top=0&amp;left=126&amp;cropWidth=1749&amp;cropHeight=1166&amp;width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p></div><a aria-labelledby=\"_R_75aucnpfiv4tb_-title\" aria-describedby=\"_R_75aucnpfiv4tb_-description\" data-ga-carousel=\"Explore more\" href=\"https://psyche.co/videos/life-on-bruny-island-population-750-is-suffused-with-trade-offs-and-joys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><div><h4>Life on Bruny Island, population 750, is suffused with trade-offs and joys</h4><p>Directed by Guido Pezz</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"Person walking on a rocky landscape under a cloudy sky, carrying a backpack and a tool or instrument over their shoulder.\" width=\"1749\" height=\"1166\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 360px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/